      H        0.9682900000       -2.2751899982        0.1151099977
      C       -0.8311900009       -1.1152000026       -0.0792599986
      H       -1.4762899991       -1.9806099993       -0.1468899997
      C       -1.3767499983        0.1650299987       -0.1432200023
      H       -2.4433799998        0.2928599984       -0.2664000001
      C       -0.5454700002        1.2803100023       -0.0611499986
      H       -0.9690000023        2.2742200005       -0.1135200001
    &END COORD
    &KIND C
      BASIS_SET TZVP-MOLOPT-SCAN-GTH-q4
      POTENTIAL GTH-SCAN-q4
